    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping away feels like a nice thought but its not really an option isn't it? like, if the fire is already here, stepping away just means watching it go dark. sometimes i feel like the only way to actually find peace is to just not be there when the walls finally come down. does that even make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
